# Headers for files served by Cloudflare's static assets layer (Workers Static
# Assets format). Worker responses (pages, /api/*) set their own headers.
#
# vinext writes dist/client/_headers only when the build output has none, and
# Vite copies this file there first, so vinext's rule is repeated below.
# Every matching rule applies and a header set by two rules is joined with a
# comma, so each header appears in exactly one rule.

/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Referrer-Policy: same-origin

# Content-hashed build output (same rule vinext generates).
/_next/static/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable

# Revalidate on every load so updates reach installed apps promptly.
/sw.js
  Cache-Control: no-cache

/manifest.webmanifest
  Cache-Control: no-cache
